            "answer": {
              "short": "$8$ fish",
              "worked": "The upper half is $6,7,7,9,11,13$.\n$\\begin{aligned}Q_3&=\\frac{7+9}{2}\\\\&=8\\text{ fish}\\end{aligned}$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
